# This directory contains JSON extraction results
# Each task creates a subdirectory with:
# - metadata.json: Task metadata, timestamps, status
# - services.json: All extracted services with the 5 primary fields
# - connections.json: Service connections/relationships
# - summary.json: Human-readable summary for quick review

# The 5 primary fields extracted for each service:
# 1. domain     - Business area (Revenue Core, Checkout, Identity)
# 2. owner      - Squad/team (Growth Squad, Platform Team)
# 3. status     - Lifecycle (Active-Dev, Maintenance-Only, Deprecated)
# 4. tier       - Criticality (Tier 1, Tier 2, Tier 3)
# 5. data_class - Sensitivity (PII, Credit-Card, Public, Internal)











